Rank excerpts you supply (code, log lines, docs passages) by how directly each answers a question, and check whether any of them answers it and whether they conflict. It does not search: shortlist candidates with grep or search first (up to 64 excerpts, 12,000 characters in total). The top-ranked excerpt can still be irrelevant, so read answerExists.

